'''Summon Greater Harbinger of Time''' is a [[skill]] granted by {{il|The Torrent's Reclamation}}.

==Skill Functions and Interactions==
The summon Harbinger is immortal, and occasionally casts {{stl|The Flow Untethered}} on the player character. {{stl|The Flow Untethered}} is an [[aura]] that lasts 8 seconds, with a cooldown of 10 seconds, granting 10% increased [[action speed]] to the player and nearby allies.

Unlike the regular version of the skill granted by {{il|The Flow Untethered}}, this buff does not affect enemies.

All "Summon Harbinger" skills share a maximum of 1 Summoned Harbinger.

